WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
Not all cooling is equal.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:11.190
Three families. Passive cooling, like shade and trees. Active cooling, like fans. And plans and money.

3
00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:15.900
Air conditioning protects people, but adds heat outside.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:21.260
A hundred and thirty-one solutions, with evidence, costs and limits.
